OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 21 Aug to Sun 30 AugFA
OL,6,Frather changeable period is likely,
OL,7,Fwith many parts of the UK seeing
OL,8,Fshowers or perhaps some longer spells
OL,9,Fof rain. However, there will be some
OL,10,Fdrier interludes as high pressure
OL,11,Fmoves across the UK at times. There is
OL,12,Falso a chance that deeper Atlantic
OL,13,Flows could lead to periods of
OL,14,Fwidespread rain and strong winds at
OL,15,Ftimes, while some outbreaks of
OL,16,Fthunderstorms are also possible.
OL,17,FTemperatures are more likely to be
OL,18,Fabove normal than below overall,
OL,19,Fthough the possibility of widespread
OL,20,For exceptional heat is lower than in
OL,21,Frecent weeks.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
